Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.44,0:00:05.56,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I need to score better\Noutside of classic lit...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.56,0:00:08.15,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I can't get a medical excuse for the quiz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.15,0:00:10.70,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,No one gets a medical excuse for a quiz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:13.89,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Oh, studying around the kotatsu, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.23,0:00:15.74,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,We have exams coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:18.55,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Nice! How about I join you—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.55,0:00:19.47,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.82,0:00:23.21,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,We don't have a place for you, Kyosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.21,0:00:24.25,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.25,0:00:27.07,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Just Sota, me, Miyamura, and Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.07,0:00:28.26,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:31.33,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Are you treating me worse by the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.33,0:00:32.17,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,I might just cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.54,0:02:06.65,Main - Top + Italics,TV,0,0,0,,I swear my wife uses this\Nlanguage wrong sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.65,0:02:08.25,Main - Top + Italics,TV,0,0,0,,Oh? How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.25,0:02:10.82,Main - Top + Italics,TV,0,0,0,,I was super depressed...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.82,0:02:13.36,Main - Top + Italics,TV,0,0,0,,so my wife cooked a meal to cheer me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:14.98,Main - Top + Italics,TV,0,0,0,,She sounds like a great wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.98,0:02:18.07,Main - Top + Italics,TV,0,0,0,,She grabbed my shoulder\Nand said with a serious face...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.32,0:02:19.66,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1270,530)\fnArial\b1\bord0\fs16\shad1\c&HA9C6EE&\3c&H514946&\4c&H35546C&\pos(134.545,210.424)}Hori Kotatsu
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.07,0:02:21.99,Main - Top + Italics,TV,0,0,0,,"A-A journey of a thousand miles\Nbegins with fifty to a hundred steps..."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.09,0:02:27.25,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Bathroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.25,0:02:36.43,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.43,0:02:38.26,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.26,0:02:39.43,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:43.57,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hori-san, wait, wait, wait! \NDon't get up! Lie back down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.57,0:02:44.18,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.18,0:02:45.26,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Yeowch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.26,0:02:46.92,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,My leg! My leg! My leg! My leg! My leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.39,0:02:53.27,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(810,1)\an5\fnComic Sans MS\bord3\fs45\fay-.5\pos(329.333,215.333)\c&H10131E&\3c&HE3ECF8&\shad0}CRAMPED
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.92,0:02:47.77,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Your leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.77,0:02:51.23,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I mean, someone's leg is locking \N my knee and I can't get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.23,0:02:53.27,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:53.27,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs20\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(530.819,286.786)}*It's hers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.27,0:02:57.09,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Aw, man... I just want to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.09,0:02:58.36,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Just do it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:03:00.28,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Don't be unreasonable!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.65,0:03:03.83,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Huh? What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:05.08,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Around ten or so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:06.62,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.62,0:03:07.77,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Keep it down, Kyoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.77,0:03:10.20,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You're twisting my leg when you move!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.20,0:03:12.52,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous. Right, Miyamura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:15.09,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Wait, Miyamura-kun? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.09,0:03:16.80,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I need to go to the bathroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.14,0:03:21.58,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I know. I'll wake up Sota. \NHe'll catch cold if he sleeps here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.58,0:03:22.87,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Sota...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.43,0:03:26.62,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,You're wrenching my leg, Miyamura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:29.47,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Stop moving, Kyosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.47,0:03:33.44,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,A cruel world where we all harm each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.69,0:03:35.55,Main - Top,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:36.42,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,What now? Should we call for help?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.42,0:03:41.34,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,That'd be too embarrassing. We're entangled\N like something out of a pervy book.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.34,0:03:42.56,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Right, Miyamura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.56,0:03:43.82,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:47.33,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You get out, Kyosuke! It's your \Nfault this is so complicated!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:47.33,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,1)\fnComic Sans MS\bord1\c&H10131E&\3c&H898DA1&\shad0\pos(180,30.666)\b1\frz18.1}Hori
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:47.33,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,1)\fnComic Sans MS\bord1\c&H10131E&\3c&H898DA1&\shad0\b1\pos(30.667,155.999)\frz18.1}Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:47.33,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,1)\fnComic Sans MS\bord1\c&H10131E&\3c&H898DA1&\shad0\b1\frz18.1\pos(138.001,233.332)}Miyamura
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.33,0:03:50.33,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,What was that? I'd get out if I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.33,0:03:54.45,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I can't take this anymore. \NI need to go so bad I can't even get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.45,0:03:55.57,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You two figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.57,0:03:57.10,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Don't give up, Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.93,0:03:59.54,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Let's review the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.54,0:04:01.49,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,We need a plan. Someone must be sacrificed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.49,0:04:04.16,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll pull as hard as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:05.34,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Please wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.86,0:04:09.98,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Kyosuke-san's right leg\Nis stuck between mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.98,0:04:13.10,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hori-san's legs are also wrapped\Npretty tightly around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:15.35,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Pulling will cause lots of pain \Nbut ultimately fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.35,0:04:16.33,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.33,0:04:18.11,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.66,0:04:21.27,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I'll yank as hard as I can, \Nso you two bear with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.27,0:04:22.61,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.61,0:04:25.08,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,What kind of idiotic idea is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:28.12,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Then answer me this! Does anyone\Nneed the bathroom more than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:32.42,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,And what about me?! My skirt's flipped, \Nbut I'm not complaining!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:34.83,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,That's not the same thing! \NNo one can even see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:37.63,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Don't go back to sleep, Kyosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:37.63,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs20\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HEDF3EF&\pos(568.819,193.453)}Disengaged
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:40.95,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have drunk so much tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.95,0:04:42.13,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Man...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:44.84,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Wait, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:49.69,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I did it! One of my legs is free!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:51.10,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Really? That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.20,0:04:53.60,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,One of mine is free, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.60,0:04:55.23,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Kyosuke, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.62,0:04:56.62,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:58.00,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,All right, I'm out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:05.24,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Did Miyamura-kun make it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:08.32,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,I'm glad that crisis is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.03,0:05:12.37,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:15.56,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Instead of lying down in\N three different directions,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:19.13,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs12\bord1\c&H10131E&\3c&H68DAE5&\shad0\b1\frz320.7\move(595.334,124.666,622.667,150.666,1,2610)}Hori
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:19.13,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs12\bord1\c&H10131E&\3c&H68DAE5&\shad0\b1\frz320.7\move(533.334,117.332,559.334,141.999,1,2610)}Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:19.13,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs12\bord1\c&H10131E&\3c&H68DAE5&\shad0\b1\frz320.7\move(527.334,162.666,551.334,187.999,1,2610)}Miyamura
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.16,0:05:19.13,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs12\bord1\c&H10131E&\3c&H68DAE5&\shad0\b1\frz11.93\move(438.001,35.999,405.334,44.666,1,2610)}Dad\h\h\hHori\h\hMiyamura
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:17.60,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,we can all do it the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:19.13,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.17,0:05:22.88,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,1)\an8\fnArial\b1\fs20\shad0\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(479.486,59.453)}They all slept in the kotatsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.47,0:05:28.53,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,When I woke up last time,\N it was already dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.53,0:05:30.64,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I'll go home at seven today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:32.82,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,That gives us about an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.82,0:05:35.31,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Crap. I might fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.31,0:05:37.22,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:49.32,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Hey, aren't you Sengoku's boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.06,0:05:55.19,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Do you remember me? \NYou used to come to our house to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.19,0:05:58.12,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, you're Kyo-chan's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.57,0:06:02.37,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Boy, you sure grew a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.37,0:06:05.54,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,No wonder, given you're Kyoko's age.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.27,0:06:10.62,Main - Top,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Man, that takes me back\Nto my high school days...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.05,0:06:09.29,Flashback,Takeru,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Kakeru.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.29,0:06:12.29,Flashback,Takeru,0,0,0,,The Horis are trouble. The parents \Nhave been since high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.29,0:06:15.73,Flashback,Takeru,0,0,0,,You have to hold your ground! Let them\Nlead you by the nose and you're in for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.73,0:06:17.48,Flashback,Young Sengoku,0,0,0,,In for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:19.57,Flashback,Takeru,0,0,0,,Trouble with a capital T!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:23.07,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,So, Kake... Uh, T-Takeru-kun, \Nhow's your dad doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:26.49,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,My name's Kakeru! \NMy dad is doing well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.26,0:06:30.29,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Oh? He is, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.71,0:06:32.99,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,He's going to do something to my dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.34,0:06:37.40,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Excuse me. I was just \Non my way to buy an eraser...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:41.31,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Since you're here, why not stop by our place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.31,0:06:44.14,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,It's cold. Come in and warm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.69,0:06:44.63,Main - Top,Sengoku,0,0,0,,No, wait... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.11,0:06:58.85,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.85,0:07:01.77,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,What? I just fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.32,0:07:04.74,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,When did Sengoku get here? And how?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.74,0:07:08.73,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Around nine. I ran into him \Noutside and invited him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.73,0:07:13.28,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Then while we were talking,\N I started getting real sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.28,0:07:15.84,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Miyamura, it's midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.84,0:07:22.48,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Gotta save... before the dungeon...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.48,0:07:23.29,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.69,0:07:27.77,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Right, President...?\NCan't forget to save, can you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.77,0:07:32.63,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, and buy some \NMP recovery items in town...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.63,0:07:33.30,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:36.18,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Encounter! Encounter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.31,0:07:39.71,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,A g-golem appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.71,0:07:41.56,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Huh? Why are you looking at {\i1}me{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:44.62,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Calm down, President!\N I'll cast a destruction spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.62,0:07:46.11,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You calm down first!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.11,0:07:48.23,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Great! The hero's party is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.23,0:07:49.57,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You stay out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.91,0:07:52.44,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Wait, what's the president doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.44,0:07:54.36,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I was abducted in my own neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.36,0:07:55.95,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,His doing, I'll bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.63,0:08:00.67,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I haven't had a bath or eaten \Ndinner, and I took a long nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.67,0:08:02.65,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, wouldn't wanna miss my bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.65,0:08:05.75,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Just use ours and quit whining, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.75,0:08:08.71,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh? But I can't show him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:11.18,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,There's something you don't want me to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.18,0:08:12.09,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Nope, nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:19.09,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Hey, that's right! You waited until late\N at night to use the bath on our field trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.09,0:08:20.61,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,D-Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.61,0:08:24.10,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,You wouldn't get in the pool, either.\N I was wondering why that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.45,0:08:27.51,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Well, y'know, I'm just so scrawny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.17,0:08:32.36,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,If {\i1}you're{\i0} scrawny, \NI might as well be a skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.65,0:08:37.62,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Th-Th-That wasn't supposed to be funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.75,0:08:50.25,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs10\shad0\an8\pos(380.667,237.334)\c&H090D0F&\3c&HECF0ED&\frz293}3 unread messages
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.25,0:08:51.53,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\fs10\shad0\an7\c&H090D0F&\3c&HECF0ED&\frz293\pos(421.333,160.001)}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:04.77,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I did it again...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.77,0:09:06.77,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,This kotatsu's bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.77,0:09:08.19,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Miyamura, wake up—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:11.48,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs8\shad0\an8\c&H090D0F&\3c&HECF0ED&\frz314.2\pos(583.333,113.334)\frx20\fry2}3 unread messages
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:11.48,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Man, he left his phone open.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.15,0:09:13.49,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You've got messages—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.61,0:09:20.28,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,Oh, crap. I sent those to Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.28,0:09:22.62,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,So that's why Chika hasn't shown.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:26.05,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,"Where are you? I know it's cold and all,\N but I'd like to apologize for the other day."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.05,0:09:28.52,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,"Can you come to the park near school?\NI'll be waiting there."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.52,0:09:31.91,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,"You can say whatever you like. I'll still \Nlove you, even though I don't say it much."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.91,0:09:33.13,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,"I know you'll understand—"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.88,0:09:36.68,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,"Love you"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.25,0:09:40.22,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Miyamura! Hey, Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.39,0:09:45.14,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,What do you want, Shindo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.14,0:09:46.27,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.15,0:09:49.26,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.15,0:09:53.03,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord3\fs30\c&H000000&\3c&HF4F7F7&\b1}Sting\h\h\h\h\h\hSting\NSting
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.26,0:09:53.41,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I feel like someone punched me \Nin the head as hard as they could.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.41,0:09:55.65,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,That can't be, can it? Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.89,0:10:00.33,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hori-san, are you asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.76,0:10:03.48,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Oh, you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.48,0:10:05.91,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Just faking it, huh? It's eight o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.91,0:10:07.81,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.81,0:10:10.23,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Why are you angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.62,0:10:12.22,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,The cause is a mystery...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:12.92,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,1)\an8\fnArial\b1\shad0\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(136.819,241.453)}It's him
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:14.63,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I'm not angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:15.51,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.51,0:10:17.42,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I just said I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.89,0:10:19.93,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hey, lookee here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.35,0:10:23.39,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,We've got mikans, your favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.39,0:10:25.19,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I'll peel one for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.82,0:10:37.40,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Wow, she actually got up for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.40,0:10:38.70,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Better not laugh, Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.17,0:10:43.71,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I decided I'd only eat two a day!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:45.88,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,So you hate mikans now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:47.67,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I don't like mikan-flavored things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.67,0:10:50.92,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Same with yuzu, citron, and grapefruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:54.08,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I don't want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.08,0:10:56.71,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,What? But I just peeled it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.71,0:10:57.74,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.13,0:10:59.01,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Get it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:00.85,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Here. Here, here. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.36,0:11:04.31,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,If you don't eat it, I'll kiss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.07,0:11:08.75,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,And I'll kiss you if you do eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:18.59,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Thank goodness you're not angry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.02,0:11:21.21,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Is that what he's been up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.61,0:11:23.92,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Hey, that message—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.57,0:11:35.02,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Why did he give it to me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.20,0:11:37.16,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Is it habit?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.86,0:11:40.30,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Want a candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.87,0:11:43.89,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:48.32,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I won't stand for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:51.21,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.08,0:11:57.98,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,That was our elementary camp trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.38,0:12:01.50,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to find pictures \Nlike this at Sengoku's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.50,0:12:03.49,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,We've been friends a long time, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.89,0:12:06.45,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Sengoku, you haven't changed one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.45,0:12:09.24,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Oh? Y-You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.74,0:12:13.05,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh? President, what album is that? \NWhat pictures are in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.05,0:12:16.50,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,O-Oh, it's nothing special.\NJust some boring ones—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.04,0:12:18.65,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,What's in there, Miyamura? Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.65,0:12:20.11,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun, let's play some games!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:22.15,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,We still have a Super Nintendo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.15,0:12:24.13,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,You wanted to play it, remember?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.51,0:12:23.15,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)\fnArial\fs12\shad0\an7\c&H0F151E&\frz10.13\pos(2.333,147.333)\3c&HD9EBF2&}Christmas with Kyoko-chan
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.51,0:12:23.15,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)\fnArial\fs12\shad0\c&H0F151E&\frz10.13\3c&HD9EBF2&\pos(362.333,172.667)}Elementary school graduation, at the front door\NCongratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.26,0:12:26.01,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,1)\fnArial\fs10\an8\shad0\c&H0F151E&\frz10.13\3c&HD9EBF2&\move(399.666,159.334,371.666,44.001,770,2750)\t(770,2750,\fs14)}Entering middle school, smiling with friend
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.04,0:12:29.58,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,It says, "Sengoku, age 12,\N screws up cutting his hair."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.58,0:12:31.68,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I wanna see! Pass it here, Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.68,0:12:34.34,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,No! You're killing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.77,0:12:34.94,Main - Top,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Man, this is hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.34,0:12:36.27,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Give it up, Sengoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.27,0:12:38.27,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs14\shad0\c&H0F151E&\3c&HD9EBF2&\pos(268.333,310)}Kyoko-chan and Kakeru swimming in the kiddie pool
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.66,0:12:38.27,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,{\an8}Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:44.38,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,Lolicon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:46.03,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.31,0:12:50.53,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,So, Miyamura, if three is as low as you go,\Nwhat's your upper limit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.53,0:12:53.54,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I don't do less than high school age,\Nthank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:58.04,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Does Kyo-chan still get changed\N in front of other people?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:04.59,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Do {\i1}any{\i0} girls change \Nin front of other people?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.59,0:13:05.60,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,She's a third-year.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:09.11,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,What? I mean, just the other day, she...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.59,0:13:12.06,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(190,1)\an8\pos(450.667,21.333)\fay-.\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs18\shad0\c&H313034&\3c&HC9C7CA&}Student Council
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.42,0:13:12.06,Flashback,Hori,0,0,0,,I have phys ed first period!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:14.77,Flashback,Hori,0,0,0,,Sengoku, let me borrow\N this room for five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.77,0:13:15.95,Flashback,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.95,0:13:18.48,Flashback,Hori,0,0,0,,I don't have time to go to the changing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.10,0:13:20.07,Flashback,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Kyo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.64,0:13:23.25,Flashback,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Doesn't this make you self-conscious?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.25,0:13:24.57,Flashback,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I'm still in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.57,0:13:25.93,Flashback,Hori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.93,0:13:29.96,Flashback,Hori,0,0,0,,So what? I could still use the toilet\Nor the bath with you in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:31.58,Flashback,Hori,0,0,0,,Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:34.81,Main - Italics,_Both,0,0,0,,She doesn't see it as a big deal at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.81,0:13:39.08,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I thought it was a bit odd, so I asked\N if the same went for Miyamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.20,0:13:41.34,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,And she said...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.87,0:13:44.08,Flashback,Hori,0,0,0,,I'd never do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.75,0:13:46.20,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,She seemed angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.20,0:13:49.44,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I-I see. Sorry, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.44,0:13:53.10,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,We took baths together all the time as kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:55.55,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Well, as kids, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:59.78,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Hang on. When was the last time we did it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.33,0:14:01.33,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.45,0:14:06.06,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I feel like we did it for an \Ninappropriately long time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.06,0:14:07.96,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid to try to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.96,0:14:09.36,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Kindergarten or so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.69,0:14:12.92,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Maybe first grade at the latest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.92,0:14:14.12,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I need to keep quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.12,0:14:15.20,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.62,0:14:21.27,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,620)\fnArial\fs18\pos(170.666,152)\c&H5C60A4&\3c&HC9DEF0&\4c&H2C3E5A&\frz22.48}Crispy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.62,0:14:21.27,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,620)\fnImpact\shad0\frz13.64\an8\pos(259.333,233.333)\bord1\c&H389A5C&\3c&H0F322C&}Nori Balls
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.62,0:14:21.27,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,620)\an3\fnArial\shad0\bord0\fs12\b1\c&H1C266B&\pos(466.667,272.667)}Lightly salted\N{\bord2\c&HFFFFFF&\b0\fs10\3c&H1922A9&}Baked, not fried
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.10,0:14:21.88,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,They have them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.40,0:14:21.88,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\fs20\shad0\frz13.64\an8\bord1\c&H389A5C&\3c&H0F322C&\pos(259.333,222.666)}Nori Balls
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.40,0:14:21.88,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,620)\an3\fnArial\shad0\bord0\fs10\b1\c&H1C266B&\pos(444.667,250)}Lightly salted\N{\bord2\c&HFFFFFF&\b0\fs8\3c&H1922A9&}Baked, not fried
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.65,0:14:21.88,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\c&H5C60A4&\3c&HC9DEF0&\4c&H2C3E5A&\frz22.48\pos(191.999,148.667)}Crispy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.88,0:14:25.47,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Sota said he likes these,\N so I wanted to try them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.47,0:14:26.51,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.85,0:14:28.09,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I'll go check out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.89,0:14:35.90,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.02,0:14:38.20,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Koyanagi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.20,0:14:40.14,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,What? Y-You're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.19,0:14:44.65,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Sengoku...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.72,0:14:49.25,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Would you happen to be Hori's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.25,0:14:51.91,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Oh, you're Sengoku-kun's father!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.91,0:14:55.49,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Kakeru-kun is always such a help to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.96,0:14:57.35,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Kind of you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:15:00.43,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You're the president's father?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.43,0:15:02.42,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hello, I'm Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.08,0:15:05.54,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,The council president and I have\N become good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.96,0:15:10.59,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,What a difference! Please don't let \Nthe Hori family corrupt you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.59,0:15:11.64,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:14.18,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Um, I can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.23,0:15:20.49,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,The president's father seems pretty nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.49,0:15:22.11,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,They're practically identical.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.11,0:15:24.62,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Think he'll look like that in a few years?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.19,0:15:27.42,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,By the way, who's Koyanagi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.42,0:15:29.75,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Oh, that's my mom's maiden name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.75,0:15:33.94,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,My parents and Sengoku's father\N went to the same high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.94,0:15:35.25,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:38.20,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,1)\fnComic Sans MS\an1\shad0\fs18\pos(34.666,28.667)\c&H122761&\3c&H3FAEE7&\b1}Probably goofed off
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:38.20,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,1)\fs10\fnArial\b1\shad0\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(98.819,215.453)}Two years younger
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:38.20,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,1)\fnComic Sans MS\an8\shad0\fs18\c&H122761&\3c&H9B56E5&\b1\pos(320,12)}Always smiling
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:38.20,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,1)\fnComic Sans MS\an9\shad0\fs18\c&H1F1428&\3c&H834E69&\b1\pos(624.667,11.333)}Probably serious (impression)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.94,0:15:38.20,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I wonder what things were like back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.75,0:15:41.35,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Hey, what are your parents like?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:42.28,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,My parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.01,0:15:44.88,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hmm, ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.88,0:15:47.58,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Oh, so just like mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:52.72,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Dummy! You still had half left!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.76,0:16:08.48,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,You guys stay quiet way too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.87,0:16:12.08,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,We're not staying quiet. \NThe conversation just keeps dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.08,0:16:14.61,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Kakeru? \NHe's terrible at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.61,0:16:15.17,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.17,0:16:19.34,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,That's not true. I was just reminiscing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.34,0:16:20.82,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Right, Kakeru-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.82,0:16:22.51,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Um, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.51,0:16:25.02,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,You can be honest, Kakeru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.02,0:16:28.51,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,There you go, ignoring his opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.80,0:16:28.51,Main - Top + Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Get me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:30.69,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,We're back! Gosh, it's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.01,0:16:33.26,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hey, President! You're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.68,0:16:34.69,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.69,0:16:36.14,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,His dad's here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.14,0:16:38.76,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,I remember you. Hurry on inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.87,0:16:46.66,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you two sitting by me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.66,0:16:48.92,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,You could sit over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.92,0:16:51.28,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It's cold by the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.64,0:16:54.49,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Now, why are you and your dad here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.49,0:16:57.53,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Your dad ran into mine \Ncoming home from work,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.53,0:16:59.77,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,and he abducted us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.77,0:17:02.04,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You're both really good at getting abducted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.04,0:17:05.64,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,The class president's so skinny, \NI feel a draft.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.39,0:17:07.54,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.54,0:17:11.17,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun, do you live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:12.92,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,You walked right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:15.05,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Half of the time, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.05,0:17:18.91,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,He's dating Kyoko. \NAren't they a cute couple?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:20.28,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.69,0:17:24.06,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Well, Kakeru has no time for such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.06,0:17:25.12,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:28.37,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Kakeru doesn't need a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.77,0:17:30.57,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,It would interfere with his studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.43,0:17:36.21,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,President, what's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.21,0:17:37.42,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Are you hiding it from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.42,0:17:41.59,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Not hiding, exactly. I just haven't \Ngotten around to telling him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.59,0:17:45.93,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I was waiting for the right time,\N and I invited Remi over for Christmas...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.93,0:17:48.12,Flashback,Remi,0,0,0,,I want it to be in my room!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.43,0:17:50.87,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,But I ended up going to her place instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.50,0:17:53.34,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I was surrounded by insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.78,0:17:57.42,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,So it's remained a secret ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.95,0:17:58.59,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.35,0:18:06.48,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\an7\fs20\shad0\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(186.152,43.452)}The "So it's a secret, is it?" face
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.63,0:18:04.76,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,President, are you cold?\NThe way you're shaking is concerning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.26,0:18:06.48,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Don't tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:08.60,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Huh? Tell your dad what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.60,0:18:09.76,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.76,0:18:10.61,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Tell me what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:17.58,Main - Top,Hori,0,0,0,,Just tell him that you've been\N dating someone for quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:18.86,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnArial\fs14\b1\c&HA2812F&\3c&HDFDFDF&\pos(320,228)}Just tell him that you've been dating someone for quite a while. You'll feel so much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.58,0:18:18.87,Main - Top,Hori,0,0,0,,You'll feel so much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.58,0:18:18.87,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,A loose cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.87,0:18:21.80,Main - Top,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Say, president, \Nhow is Ayasaki-san today?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.80,0:18:24.87,Main - Top,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry! You're keeping her\N a secret, right? That just slipped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.03,0:18:24.87,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,And an oblivious time bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.20,0:18:27.58,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,The oblivious time bomb is the real danger...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.58,0:18:28.43,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Namely, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.43,0:18:30.38,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm a person!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:34.24,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Kakeru-kun probably has someone he's into.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.24,0:18:37.29,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Isn't it unreasonable to say he can't date?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.29,0:18:39.88,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,This could work!\NMaybe this will settle things!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.88,0:18:43.39,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Shut up. Enough of that.\NStay out of our family affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.69,0:18:47.24,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Your whole way of thinking \Nis outdated. Get with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.24,0:18:49.66,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Don't boss me around. I'm older than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.66,0:18:53.02,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,You bring me here on my personal time \Nand think you can lecture me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.02,0:18:55.71,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,When you forgot your lunch, \NI gave you some bread from the store!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.71,0:18:57.06,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Yeah, about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.06,0:19:00.12,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,That bread cost 80 yen,\N but you asked me for 100!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:02.49,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,They're not even talking about \Nthe same thing any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:03.30,Main - Top,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,How ungrateful! I can't believe you!\NKyoko, don't be like this when you grow up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.49,0:19:04.37,Main - Italics,Takeru,0,0,0,,It almost seems...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:06.41,Main - Top,Takeru,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, Kakeru?\NThis is fraud, plain and simple!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.37,0:19:06.41,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Instead of adults, they're fighting like...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.30,0:19:09.21,Main - Italics,_All,0,0,0,,High schoolers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.71,0:19:11.34,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Are you sure that's a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.34,0:19:15.40,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Walking through what looks like a rain puddle\Ncan get you soaked up to your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:16.81,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Are you sure that's a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.81,0:19:18.17,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,You already said that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:22.09,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Although, compared to the idiot who arrived \Nat school {\i1}after{\i0} all the exams were over...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.09,0:19:25.10,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,That was only because \Nsomeone stole my front wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:26.68,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Then walk instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.93,0:19:29.62,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,This is embarrassing. I wish they'd shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.93,0:19:30.19,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\fnComic Sans MS\bord3\shad0\b1\c&H121C23&\3c&HE4E8EA&}YAMMER YAMMER
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:32.52,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Yeah? It's always like this here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.07,0:19:36.32,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You two are such good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:39.47,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Yup! We're best friends, right, Sengoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.47,0:19:41.36,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Shut up! Best friends, my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.36,0:19:44.32,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive \Nwhat you did at graduation!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.32,0:19:47.91,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Just as I was giving my \Nspeech as council president...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.32,0:19:48.60,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,290)\fnArial\fs8\shad0\bord0\pos(395.333,232.667)\c&H333533&}Speech
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.91,0:19:49.06,Flashback,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.06,0:19:51.58,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,You had that sneeze planned, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.95,0:19:54.92,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,That sneeze... came from \Nthe student body rep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.92,0:19:56.59,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,We didn't have a student body rep!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.59,0:19:59.84,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Let's go back to talking \Nabout Sengoku's girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.84,0:20:02.09,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(190,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs32\bord0\shad0\b1\i1\pos(374.666,250)\c&H1A1F26&\frz20.33}S{\fs34}H{\fs36}O{\fs38}C{\fs40}K
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.84,0:20:04.32,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,No! Feel free to keep reminiscing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.32,0:20:06.66,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Don't try to laugh it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:10.10,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,It seems that the Sengokus...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.68,0:20:13.25,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,are still at the mercy of the Horis.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.02,0:20:23.11,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Listen, Kakeru. You do not \Nneed a girlfriend right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.11,0:20:26.20,Main,Takeru,0,0,0,,Especially not one like Hori's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.20,0:20:28.12,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,There's no way I can tell him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.20,0:20:35.15,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Imports are stuff that comes into Japan...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.12,0:20:38.77,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I hope I can score at least 40 on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.77,0:20:41.63,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Can I get that high? I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.17,0:20:43.32,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Did you study for math?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.32,0:20:45.04,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.04,0:20:47.64,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You gave up at the beginning\N of the school year.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.15,0:20:50.05,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Try picking it back up instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.12,0:20:53.14,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You're eating so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.84,0:20:55.78,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Your nails will turn orange.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:20:57.65,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I'm not eating {\i1}that{\i0} many.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.82,0:21:01.15,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Don't say I didn't warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:04.81,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.81,0:21:07.91,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Me eating won't do anything\N about your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.36,0:21:10.87,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.65,0:21:21.76,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,This is like...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.41,0:21:24.92,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,feeding an animal! I'll give him another.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.15,0:21:53.99,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I cleaned your finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.46,0:22:00.96,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,1)\fnArial\b1\an4\shad0\bord0\c&H191806&}Drip
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.96,0:22:03.13,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It's not clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.46,0:22:07.71,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hori-san, I'll skip everything\N except classic lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.71,0:22:09.14,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:40.32,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(487,1)\pos(485.1,319.204)\c&HC2A774&\3c&HF4F9ED&\shad0\an7\fs16\pos(452.242,317.744)}Next time\Npage.5 Iura
